        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, your contract today is to ruin Mr. Krugers career, our client has a long standing grudge with Mr, Kruger, and as such ordered us to completely ruin his career, we havee found out that he has a show going on in paris, and possibly something a bit darker with dalia. as such she has also been cleared as a target. i wish you the best of luck fy, i&apos;ll leave you to decide how to handle this.\r\rIdentically recreated from a Playstation contract of the same name: 2-02-9097682-04",
